<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate falls to 3.6 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate falls to 3.6 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     MARCH 1997   FEB 1997    MARCH 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	    3.6	  3.8	   4.3</p>
<p> Unemployed			  81,500     83,600	94,918</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			   N/A	 82,982	93,139</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
